id: DRAFT-qm-dsp-1.7.1-boost-test-detailed-assertion-full-pass
trigger_tool: make|conan|test
phase: testing
error_signature: missing-No-errors-detected|ERROR: \[upstream-test\].*FAIL.*missing-No-errors-detected
severity: 3
category: testing, build-system, ohos
match_keywords: boost_test, report_level_detailed, hmbs_repair_method
title: Boost.Test以--report_level=detailed运行时以断言行满通过替代短尾标判定
root_cause: --report_level=detailed下Boost.Test只输出逐用例N assertions out of M passed行，从不打印短报告尾标No errors detected，旧ok_text检查系统性为假导致exit=0仍判0/64失败
affected_scope: 以--report_level=detailed运行Boost.Test并需机器判定的所有上游测试判定，适用于所有同模式配方
affected_scope: 以--report_level=detailed运行Boost.Test并需机器判定的所有上游测试判定，适用于所有同模式配方
verification_cmd: 真机日志核对exit==0且Running N==审计期望且全部assertions out of passed行满通过，info行full-pass-assert-lines计数非空；本任务验证64/64 passed
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: parse-detailed-assertions-full-pass
rec_description: 删除No-errors-detected字符串检查，新增正则解析全部assertions out of passed行，要求至少一行且全部满通过，成功条件改为exit==0且Running N==审计期望且断言行满通过
rec_command: archives/q/qm-dsp/1.7.1/conanfile.py: 删除ok_text检查并新增断言行正则与full-pass-assert-lines计数日志后复跑真机预检
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: keep-exit-plus-running-count-only
fallback_description: 若上游改report级别导致断言行形态变化，保留exit==0与Running计数审计并记录原始输出待重审正则，不回退短尾标检查
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: missing-No-errors-detected|No-errors-detected
forbid_1_reason: 禁止在--report_level=detailed下仍以短尾标为通过条件；该模式从不打印该尾标会导致系统性误判
forbid_1_consequence: 真机6二进制exit=0仍判0/64失败，门禁退回修复循环
similar_to: [DRAFT-tmpdir-readonly-false-positive, DRAFT-ctest-automake-munit-summary-parse]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-qm-dsp-1.7.1-boost-test-detailed-assertion-full-pass.md
last_updated: 2026-09-22
source_event: qm-dsp/1.7.1真机预检6二进制exit=0但误判0/64并修复为断言行满通过判定后64/64通过
 Protections: hmbs-executor
